   "title": "SDXL / PonyXL Models Guide",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## SDXL & PonyXL Checkpoints\n\n**Newly Added SDXL/Pony Models:**\n- `gonzalomoXLFluxPony_v70PhotoXL.safetensors` (Full non-DMD PhotoXL v7.0: 28-30 steps, CFG 5.0-5.5, supports Pony `score_9` tags)\n- `sdxlPhotorealisticMix_v10.safetensors` (Photorealistic SDXL: 28-30 steps, CFG 5.5, natural/tag prompts)\n- `uberRealisticPornMergePonyxl_xlV6Final.safetensors` (URPM PonyXL v6 Final: 28-30 steps, CFG 5.5, Pony `score_9` tags)\n\n**Other Installed SDXL Checkpoints:**\n- `bigLust_v16.safetensors`, `juggernautXL_ragnarok.safetensors`, `intorealismUltra_v10.safetensors`, `pornworksRealPornPhoto_v03.safetensors`, `sdxlUnstableDiffusers_nihilmania.safetensors`\n- `gonzalomoXLFluxPony_v70PhotoXLDMD.safetensors` (DMD distilled: use 6-8 steps, CFG 1.5-2.0)\n\n**LoRA Stack:**\n- `SDXL_BetterFaces-LoRA_v1.safetensors` (0.5 - 0.7)\n- `DetailedEyes_V3.safetensors` (0.6 - 0.8)\n*(For SD 1.5 checkpoints like `limitlessvision_v40`, `savMIXSD15_v62`, `stablegram_v24`, use workflows 17 & 18!)*"
   ],
   "color": "#223",
   "bgcolor": "#335"
  },
